'''Handsaw''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by [[crafting]] it during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. To craft it, players needed a [[Saw]] [[File:Saw.png|25px|link=Saw]] and 100 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift2015}}. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It has a long, jagged blade, resembling that of a real handsaw, hence the name. Without a guard, it has a dark brown hilt, connected to the blade with screws and spikes all over it, along with a dark gray taped-like handle.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/54694324/Saw-Sword Saw Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 550 Robux.
*When salvaged, it provides 255 godly [[Shards|shards]].
*This was the first godly which could be claimed by giving gifts. 

